    ],
    "trigger_rationale": "The implicit-transition API assigns exit to Raft. appliedTo explicitly admits transfer rejection and relies on a next advance, while abortLeaderTransfer only clears a field. Inspect all callers and pending-work production before choosing a controlled execution; this is more discriminating than testing already composed durability guards or the ReadIndex path whose caller retry duty is explicit.",
